  "slug": "inventory-adjustment-training-sign-off-form",
  "title": "Inventory Adjustment Training Sign-Off Form",
  "subtitle": "A practical observed-practice training sign-off for inventory adjustment that connects identity, observations and evidence, decision authority, exception ownership, and accountable closeout.",
  "description": "An original retail-operations observed-practice training sign-off for inventory adjustment covering inventory count and adjustment, evidence references, authorization, escalation, operating limits, disposition, and handoff without copying a third-party form.",
  "use_case": "Use when a inventory control lead opens one inventory adjustment record to plan instruction, observe practice, identify knowledge and authority limits, assign follow-up, and acknowledge the resulting work scope; closure requires a documented outcome, evidence route, responsible owner, and recipient acknowledgment.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
  "sections": [
