              "units": 1.15
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "competencies",
          "type": "checklist",
          "label": "Adjustment competencies",
          "items": [
            "Confirms SKU, unit, lot or serial, and location",
            "Captures system quantity before counting",
            "Performs an unbiased physical count",
            "Uses independent recount when required",
            "Researches open inventory movements",
            "Separates evidence from assumptions about cause",
            "Applies approval limits before posting",
            "Verifies the posted transaction",
            "Routes repeated patterns to an authorized reviewer",
            "Hands off downstream and unresolved impacts"
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "training_boundary",
          "type": "notice",
          "label": "Training and authorization boundary",
          "guidance": "Record count facts, system references, and authorized reasons without assigning blame or alleging theft. Do not alter source transactions to force agreement. Follow applicable inventory, financial-control, privacy, and retention policy; route product restrictions, loss patterns, or accounting conclusions to the authorized reviewer. This sign-off records observed practice and assigned limits; it is not a license, professional certification, or guarantee of future performance."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
